"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Sul</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:160
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is horizontal, and the measurements are on the "
"bottom (South) of the ruler"
msgstr ""
"xira o &kruler; para que a regra sexa horizontal e as medidas están na parte "
"inferior (Sul) da regra"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:166
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>W</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>West</guimenuitem>"
