"<shortcut> <keycap>W</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Oeste</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:175
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns &kruler; so the ruler is vertical, and the measurements are on the "
"left (West) of the ruler"
msgstr ""
"Xira o &kruler; para que a regra sexa vertical e as medidas están na "
"esquerda (Oeste) da regra)"

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:181
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>R</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Turn Right</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>R</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Xirar á dereita</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:190
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns the ruler 90 Degrees to the right. For example, if it is oriented "
"South, it will rotate to be oriented West."
msgstr ""
"Xira a regra 90 graos á dereita. Por exemplo, se está orientada para o Sul, "
"xira para estar orientada para o Oeste."

#. Tag: menuchoice
#: index.docbook:196
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>L</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientation</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Turn Left</guimenuitem>"
msgstr ""
"<shortcut> <keycap>L</keycap> </shortcut> <guisubmenu>Orientación</"
"guisubmenu> <guimenuitem>Xirar á esquerda</guimenuitem>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:205
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Turns the ruler 90 Degrees to the left. For example, if it is oriented West, "
"it will rotate to be oriented South."
msgstr ""
"Xira a regra 90 graos á esquerda. Por exemplo, se está orientada para o "
"Oeste, xira para estar orientada para o Sul."

